00:26:07,750 --> 00:26:10,050
コマ送りメモリー イルミの前手を取り
Frame-by-frame memory; taking your hand before the illuminations,

337
00:26:10,050 --> 00:26:13,750
言葉と指を交わそうよ 恋のセオリー
let's exchange words and intertwine our fingers, the theory of love.

338
00:26:13,750 --> 00:26:16,450
ティンクルくるせいだーす
Twinkle Crusaders,

339
00:26:16,450 --> 00:26:19,250
マーズ・アタック！ ザスラですら
even Mars Attacks! or Zathura...

340
00:26:19,250 --> 00:26:21,750
全部架空 ヒエログリフだって
it's all fiction; even hieroglyphs

341
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:25,750
誰かの解釈 読めるわけないのにね
are just someone's interpretation—not like anyone can read them.

342
00:26:25,750 --> 00:26:28,750
この物語はフィクションです
This story is a work of fiction;

343
00:26:28,750 --> 00:26:31,450
君との遭遇は嘘なんです
my encounter with you was a lie.

344
00:26:31,450 --> 00:26:34,150
feel alright 痛くも痒くもない
Feel alright, it doesn't hurt or itch at all,

345
00:26:34,150 --> 00:26:36,950
けど 黄色ゲージ スタミナない
but my gauge is yellow—I've got no stamina.

346
00:26:36,950 --> 00:26:39,550
教えてFilmarks 空っぽの人生
Tell me, Filmarks: for an empty life,

347
00:26:39,550 --> 00:26:41,950
星何点？ 欲しがってる
how many stars? I'm longing for

348
00:26:41,950 --> 00:26:44,450
満点の星 120個
a full score of 120 stars,

349
00:26:44,450 --> 00:26:47,050
いや1個で十分かも
or maybe just one is enough.

350
00:26:47,050 --> 00:26:49,650
Wow! Signal 送り返す
Sending back a "Wow! Signal",

351
00:26:49,650 --> 00:26:52,550
君は返事もくれないまま
yet you still leave me without a reply.

352
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:55,250
炭酸のないサイダー
A flat cider soda,

353
00:26:55,250 --> 00:26:59,050
飲み干せないや まだまだ
I still can't finish drinking it, not yet.

354
00:26:59,050 --> 00:27:01,350
裸足のまま踊る夜
Dancing barefoot into the night,

355
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:03,750
寒くはないけどココアを飲む
I'm not cold, but I drink hot cocoa.

356
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:06,550
誰かが見てる 私も誰かを見てる
Someone is watching, and I'm watching someone too.

357
00:27:06,550 --> 00:27:09,750
108 アメと恋とゲーム
108, candy, love, and games.

358
00:27:09,750 --> 00:27:12,750
最高のfriendだ お布団
My best friend is my futon...

359
00:27:12,750 --> 00:27:14,950
twinkle night たゆたう
Twinkle night, drifting away,

360
00:27:14,950 --> 00:27:17,350
夢遊病患者の寝言
sleep-talk of a sleepwalker.

361
00:27:17,350 --> 00:27:20,150
甘い雲はバニラの香りがするんだ
Sweet clouds smell of vanilla.

362
00:27:20,150 --> 00:27:23,550
包んだはずの足は寒くて引っ込めた
I tucked my feet in, but they got cold so I pulled them back.

363
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:26,250
きっとまた はみ出した
I must have fallen asleep

364
00:27:26,250 --> 00:27:28,150
ままで寝てしまったんだ
with them sticking out again.

365
00:27:28,150 --> 00:27:30,250
まった あったまったらまた
Wait; once I warm up again,

366
00:27:30,250 --> 00:27:32,550
彼方 あなたとなら 九日十日
far away, if it's with you, for nine or ten days.

367
00:27:32,550 --> 00:27:36,550
どうか 音は星を超えた
Somehow, the sound reached beyond the stars.

368
00:27:36,550 --> 00:27:39,250
そっか やっぱり夢か
I see... so it was just a dream after all.

369
00:27:39,250 --> 00:27:42,250
わかっても 瞳は閉じたまま
Even knowing that, I keep my eyes closed.

370
00:27:42,250 --> 00:27:44,950
君と過ごす夜 少しアーバン
Spending the night with you, slightly urban,

371
00:27:44,950 --> 00:27:47,450
処理速度 高速 私から
high processing speed, sent from me,

372
00:27:47,450 --> 00:27:49,750
送るデータは膨大
the data is massive.

373
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:52,950
「無理、受け取れない」とかダメだよ！愛して twinkle night
"I can't take it all" is not an option! Love me, twinkle night.

374
00:27:52,950 --> 00:27:55,550
君と過ごす夜 少しアーバン
Spending the night with you, slightly urban,

375
00:27:55,550 --> 00:27:57,950
甘々なひととき 君にオーダー
ordering a super-sweet moment with you.

376
00:27:57,950 --> 00:28:00,250
コマ送りメモリー イルミの前手を取り
Frame-by-frame memory; taking your hand before the illuminations,

377
00:28:00,250 --> 00:28:04,250
言葉と指を交わそうよ 恋のセオリー
let's exchange words and intertwine our fingers, the theory of love.

378
00:28:04,250 --> 00:28:06,750
君と過ごす夜 少しアーバン
Spending the night with you, slightly urban,

379
00:28:06,750 --> 00:28:09,150
処理速度 高速 私から
high processing speed, sent from me,

380
00:28:09,150 --> 00:28:11,550
送るデータは膨大
the data is massive.

381
00:28:11,550 --> 00:28:16,250
「無理、受け取れない」とかダメだよ！愛して twinkle night
"I can't take it all" is not an option! Love me, twinkle night.

382
00:28:47,950 --> 00:28:51,750
世界で一番おひめさま
The number one princess in the whole wide world—

383
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:58,250
そういう扱い 心得てよね
you'd better know how to treat me like one, okay?

384
00:29:00,250 --> 00:29:01,950
やーね！
Jeez!

385
00:29:02,750 --> 00:29:08,250
ワールドイズマイン CPK! Remix
[Song: World is Mine (CPK! Remix)]

386
00:29:08,550 --> 00:29:09,750
1, 2, 3!

387
00:29:16,550 --> 00:29:21,250
その一 いつもと違う髪形に気がつくこと
Number one: Notice when my hairstyle is different from usual.

388
00:29:21,250 --> 00:29:25,750
その二 ちゃんと靴までみること いいね？
Number two: Make sure to check out my shoes too, got it?

389
00:29:25,750 --> 00:29:30,250
その三 わたしの一言には３つの言葉で返事すること
Number three: Reply to every word I say with three words.

390
00:29:30,250 --> 00:29:34,550
わかったら右手がお留守なのを なんとかして！
If you understand, do something about my lonely right hand!

391
00:29:34,550 --> 00:29:38,250
べつに わがままなんて言ってないんだから
It's not like I'm being selfish or anything,

392
00:29:38,250 --> 00:29:43,250
きみに 心から思ってほしいの かわいいって
I just want you to think I'm cute from the bottom of your heart.

393
00:29:43,250 --> 00:29:48,750
かわいいって
That I'm cute!

394
00:29:49,250 --> 00:29:52,950
世界で一番おひめさま
The number one princess in the whole wide world—

395
00:29:52,950 --> 00:29:55,750
気がついて ねえねえ
pay attention to me, hey, hey!

396
00:29:55,750 --> 00:29:58,750
待たせるなんて論外よ
Keeping me waiting is out of the question.

397
00:29:58,750 --> 00:30:01,750
わたしを誰だと思ってるの？ もうなんだか
Who do you think I am? Geez, I kind of...

398
00:30:03,108 --> 00:30:06,308
甘いものが食べたい
I want to eat something sweet!

399
00:30:09,108 --> 00:30:11,108
今すぐに
Right this instant!

400
00:30:13,108 --> 00:30:14,308
Yeah

401
00:30:16,908 --> 00:30:18,608
Hey baby

402
00:30:25,608 --> 00:30:28,108
欠点？ かわいいの間違いでしょ
Flaws? You must mean my cute quirks, right?

403
00:30:28,108 --> 00:30:30,608
文句は許しませんの
I won't accept any complaints!

404
00:30:30,608 --> 00:30:34,108
あのね？ 私の話 ちゃんと聞いてる？ ちょっと…
Hey, are you listening to what I'm saying? Excuse me...

405
00:30:34,108 --> 00:30:37,608
あ、それとね？ 白いお馬さん 決まってるでしょ？
Oh, and by the way, a white horse is a given, right?

406
00:30:37,608 --> 00:30:39,108
迎えに来て
Come pick me up.

407
00:30:39,108 --> 00:30:43,108
分かったら 傅いて 手を取って「お姫様」って
If you understand, kneel down, take my hand, and call me "Princess."

408
00:30:43,108 --> 00:30:47,308
べつに わがままなんて言ってないんだから
It's not like I'm being selfish or anything.

409
00:30:47,308 --> 00:30:52,108
でもね 少しぐらい 叱ってくれたっていいのよ？
But you know, it's okay to scold me just a little bit, right?

410
00:30:58,308 --> 00:31:02,308
世界で わたしだけの王子様
My one and only prince in the whole world,

411
00:31:02,308 --> 00:31:06,608
気がついて ほらほら おててがあいてます
notice me, look, look! My hand is open and waiting!

412
00:31:06,908 --> 00:31:10,608
無口で 無愛想な王子様
You silent, blunt prince...

413
00:31:10,608 --> 00:31:14,908
もう どうして 気がついてよ 早く
Geez, why? Notice me already, hurry!

414
00:31:14,908 --> 00:31:22,108
絶対 キミは 分かってない！ 分かってないわ
You definitely don't get it! You really don't get it!

415
00:31:22,108 --> 00:31:24,608
わー
Wahhh~

416
00:31:26,608 --> 00:31:28,108
Yeah

417
00:31:30,908 --> 00:31:34,608
いちごの乗ったショートケーキ
Shortcake topped with strawberries,

418
00:31:34,908 --> 00:31:39,108
こだわりたまごのとろけるプリン
melting pudding made with specially selected eggs...

419
00:31:39,108 --> 00:31:41,908
みなみな 我慢します
I'll hold myself back from all of them,

420
00:31:41,908 --> 00:31:44,108
わがままな子だと思わないで
so please don't think I'm a selfish girl.

421
00:31:44,108 --> 00:31:47,108
わたしだってやればできるもん
Even I can do it if I try!

422
00:31:47,108 --> 00:31:49,608
あとで後悔するわよ
You're going to regret this later!

423
00:31:53,108 --> 00:31:56,108
当然です！ だってわたしは
Of course! Because after all, I am...

424
00:31:56,108 --> 00:31:59,608
世界で 一番おひめさま
the number one princess in the world!

425
00:31:59,608 --> 00:32:03,108
ちゃんと見ててよね どこかに行っちゃうよ？
Keep your eyes on me, okay? Or I might wander off somewhere!

426
00:32:03,108 --> 00:32:07,108
ふいに抱きしめられた 急に そんな え？
Suddenly pulled into a hug... so out of nowhere, huh?

427
00:32:07,108 --> 00:32:10,108
「轢かれる 危ないよ」
"You'll get hit, watch out!"

428
00:32:10,108 --> 00:32:13,908
そう言って そっぽ向く キミ
Saying that, you look the other way...

429
00:32:13,908 --> 00:32:17,608
こっちのが危ないわよ
You're the one who's dangerous!

430
00:32:19,308 --> 00:32:21,108
Yeah

431
00:32:22,608 --> 00:32:24,108
Hey baby

432
00:32:42,608 --> 00:32:46,108
はーい！ というわけで
All right! And with that,

433
00:32:46,108 --> 00:32:50,608
3曲連続でお届けしましたが、どうでしたかー？
I just performed three songs in a row! How did you like them?

434
00:32:51,108 --> 00:32:57,108
『Starry Night』に、ポルカ、ベーちゃん、ビブ、そしてちはー！
In "Starry Night", with Polka, Bae-chan, Biboo, and Chiha-!

435
00:32:57,108 --> 00:32:59,108
5人で歌いましたー！
The five of us sang together!

436
00:32:59,108 --> 00:33:01,608
めっちゃめちゃかっこよくなかったー？
Didn't it look super, super cool?

437
00:33:02,108 --> 00:33:05,908
なんかいいよね、みんなで一緒に踊るのっていいよね！
It's so nice, isn't it? Dancing together with everyone is great!

438
00:33:06,108 --> 00:33:11,608
そして、『Twinkle Night』を、ぺこらと一緒に歌いましたー！
And then, I sang "Twinkle Night" together with Pekora!

439
00:33:12,108 --> 00:33:19,608
そして、最後は『ワールドイズマイン』、CPKのRemixバージョンになりまーす！
And lastly, "World Is Mine", in the CPK remix version!

440
00:33:20,108 --> 00:33:23,608
世界で一番お姫様だったー？
Was I the number one princess in the world?

441
00:33:24,608 --> 00:33:27,108
お姫様だったー？
Was I your princess?

442
00:33:29,608 --> 00:33:33,908
ここでもね、みんなに募集したイラストが降ってきましたけど、
Here as well, the illustrations you all submitted came raining down,

443
00:33:33,908 --> 00:33:37,608
自分のみつけられた人いたかなー？
but I wonder if anyone was able to find their own?

444
00:33:37,908 --> 00:33:41,108
見つけたら、いっぱい写真撮っといてくださいねー！
If you found it, make sure to take lots of screenshots, okay?

445
00:33:41,108 --> 00:33:42,308
はーい！
Yay!

446
00:33:42,308 --> 00:33:45,608
というわけで3曲をお届けしたんですけど、
So I just delivered those three songs to you,

447
00:33:45,608 --> 00:33:49,108
かっこいいもあり、かわいいもあり、いかがでしたか？
with cool vibes and cute vibes! How did you like it?

448
00:33:49,108 --> 00:33:51,908
え、そう！ ステージ、流れ星
Oh, right! On stage, shooting stars

449
00:33:51,908 --> 00:33:54,608
バーンって降ってきたの！
came raining down with a bam!

450
00:33:54,608 --> 00:33:58,608
ほら見て！ 星空ー！
Look at that! A starry sky!

451
00:33:58,608 --> 00:34:03,108
すごい、このステージね、マジ無限の可能性を感じるんだよね。
Amazing! I really feel endless possibilities on this stage.

452
00:34:03,608 --> 00:34:06,608
何でもできる気がする！ うん。
I feel like I can do anything! Yeah.

453
00:34:06,608 --> 00:34:10,608
いや、ホロメンと一緒に歌えるの楽しいなー。
Man, it's so much fun being able to sing with my Hololive friends.

454
00:34:10,608 --> 00:34:16,608
1年に1回のこのライブ、思い切り好きなことできるのがすごい楽しい。
In this once-a-year live, getting to do whatever I love to my heart's content is so fun!

455
00:34:16,608 --> 00:34:20,608
そして衣装も久しぶりに、和装でございます！
And for my outfit, for the first time in a while, it's traditional Japanese attire!

456
00:34:20,608 --> 00:34:23,108
あにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃ！
A-nya-nya-nya-nya-nya-nya-nya!

457
00:34:23,108 --> 00:34:30,608
そう、『ワールドイズマイン』はね、ちょっとかぐやのやつでいいなって思って、歌いたくなっちゃったので、
Yeah, for "World Is Mine", I loved Kaguya-sama's version and really wanted to sing it,

458
00:34:30,608 --> 00:34:35,608
せっかくだから、かぐやに合わせて和装でね、歌ってみましたー！
so since I had the chance, I matched Kaguya and tried singing it in Japanese attire!

459
00:34:36,108 --> 00:34:39,908
「欠点？ かわいいの間違いでしょ！」
"Flaws? You must mean cute quirks, right!"

460
00:34:39,908 --> 00:34:42,608
ポンだっていいでしょ！
Being a bit clumsy is fine too, right?

461
00:34:42,608 --> 00:34:46,108
まあ今日ポンはしてないんですけどもねー。
Well, I haven't been clumsy today, though!

462
00:34:46,108 --> 00:34:51,108
なぜか知らないけど、歌だけは高性能って言われるしなー。
For some reason, people always say only my singing is high-spec!

463
00:34:51,608 --> 00:34:53,108
はーい！
Yep!

464
00:34:54,608 --> 00:35:00,108
でも、今そんな「空ー！」って言ってたけど…
But anyway, I was just shouting "The sky!" like that, but...

465
00:35:01,453 --> 00:35:05,053
今日限りでまた海に沈んじゃうんだって、この場所
They say this place will sink back into the ocean after today.

466
00:35:05,453 --> 00:35:08,253
そんなのもったいないよねー
That's such a waste, isn't it?

467
00:35:08,553 --> 00:35:12,153
ロボサーなんかいい方法知らない？
Robosa, do you know any good ideas?

468
00:35:12,653 --> 00:35:17,153
ボクが高性能だからきっと知ってるかなーと思って
I thought since I'm high-spec, maybe you'd know...

469
00:35:17,553 --> 00:35:20,753
うん。ふんふん、ふんふん。
Hmm. Mhm, mhm.

470
00:35:21,253 --> 00:35:23,253
あっ、ひらめいた！
Ah, I've got an idea!

471
00:35:23,553 --> 00:35:29,353
海は海でも、電子の海に沈めちゃえばいいんだー！
If it's the sea, we can just sink it into the digital sea!

472
00:35:31,653 --> 00:35:34,353
い、いいんだー！
Y-Yeah, that works!

473
00:35:34,353 --> 00:35:36,753
そうだよなー！
That's right!

474
00:35:37,553 --> 00:35:42,653
というわけで、ちょっとやっちゃおうかなー
So, I guess I'll go ahead and do it!

475
00:35:43,253 --> 00:35:46,153
お願いしまーす！
Here goes!

476
00:35:46,653 --> 00:35:47,553
パチン
Snap!

477
00:35:47,753 --> 00:35:49,853
これパチンってなった？
Did that snap properly?

478
00:36:13,553 --> 00:36:20,253
悲しみの海に沈んだ私 目を開けるのも億劫
Sunk into a sea of sadness, it's a chore to even open my eyes.

479
00:36:20,353 --> 00:36:27,753
このままどこまでも堕ちて行き 誰にも見つけられないのかな
Falling endlessly like this, will no one ever find me?

480
00:36:27,853 --> 00:36:31,653
どこへ向かい 何をすれば？
Where should I head? What should I do?

481
00:36:31,653 --> 00:36:34,653
ふと射し込む一筋の光
Suddenly, a single ray of light shines through.

482
00:36:34,653 --> 00:36:37,753
手を伸ばせば届きそうだけど
If I reach out, it seems I could touch it,

483
00:36:37,753 --> 00:36:41,653
波に攫われて見失った
but swept away by the waves, I lost sight of it.

484
00:36:41,753 --> 00:36:45,253
あれは一体なんだったのかな
Just what in the world was that?

485
00:36:45,253 --> 00:36:48,753
あたたかくて眩しかったの
It was so warm and dazzling.

486
00:36:48,753 --> 00:36:52,653
無意識のカウンターイルミネーション
An unconscious counter-illumination...

487
00:36:52,653 --> 00:36:55,553
嘘つきは誰？
Who is the liar?

488
00:36:55,553 --> 00:36:58,653
深海少女 まだまだ沈む
Deep sea girl, sinking further and further,

489
00:36:58,653 --> 00:37:02,653
暗闇の彼方へ閉じこもる
shutting herself away beyond the darkness.

490
00:37:02,653 --> 00:37:06,253
深海少女 だけど知りたい
Deep sea girl, but she wants to know,

491
00:37:06,253 --> 00:37:12,853
心惹かれるあの人を見つけたから
because she found the one who captivated her heart.

492
00:37:16,353 --> 00:37:20,153
昼も夜も無かったこの場所
In this place where neither day nor night existed,

493
00:37:20,153 --> 00:37:23,753
なのに眠れない夜は続く
sleepless nights continue nonetheless.

494
00:37:23,753 --> 00:37:27,253
自由の羽大きく広げて
Spreading your wings of freedom wide,

495
00:37:27,253 --> 00:37:30,753
泳ぐあなたは綺麗でした
swimming, you were so beautiful.

496
00:37:30,753 --> 00:37:34,453
そしてまた光は降り注ぐ
And then, light pours down once more.

497
00:37:34,453 --> 00:37:38,053
見とれていたら目が合った
As I watched entranced, our eyes met.

498
00:37:38,053 --> 00:37:41,653
気付いてこっちを振り返るあなたに
To you, who noticed and looked back at me,

499
00:37:41,653 --> 00:37:44,753
嘘つきな私
I am a liar...

500
00:37:44,753 --> 00:37:48,153
深海少女 わざわざ沈む
Deep sea girl, sinking on purpose,

501
00:37:48,153 --> 00:37:51,853
暗闇のさなかに赤い頬
cheeks blushing red in the midst of darkness.

